{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-zec-10-1","title":"Zechariah 10:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 God is to be sought unto, and not idols. 3 As he visited his flock for sin, so he will save and restore them.</p>\n<p>ye. Eze 36:37; Mt 7:7,8; Joh 16:23; Jas 5:16-18 rain in. De 11:13; 28:23; 1Ki 17:1; 18:41-45; Isa 5:6; 30:23; Jer 14:22 Am 4:7 the time. De 11:14; Job 29:23; Pr 16:15; Ho 6:3; Joe 2:23,24; Jas 5:7 bright clouds. or, lightnings. Job 36:27-31; 37:1-6; Jer 10:13; 51:16 and give. Ps 65:9; 72:6; 104:13; Isa 44:3; Eze 34:26; Ho 10:12; Mic 5:7 1Co 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-2","title":"Zechariah 10:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the idols. Heb. the teraphims. Ge 31:19; Jud 18:14; Isa 44:9; 46:5; Jer 10:8; 14:22; Ho 3:4 Hab 2:18 the diviners. Jer 23:25-27; 27:9; 29:8,21,22; La 2:14; Eze 13:6-16,22,23; 21:29 Mic 3:6-11 they comfort. Job 13:4; 21:34; Jer 6:14; 8:11; 14:13; 23:17; 28:4-6,15; 37:19 therefore. Jer 13:17-20; 50:17; 51:23; Mic 2:12 troubled, because there. or, answered that there. Nu 27:17; 1Ki 22:17; Eze 34:5,8; Mt 9:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-3","title":"Zechariah 10:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>anger. 11:5-8,17; Isa 56:9-12; Jer 10:21; 23:1,2; 50:6; Eze 34:2,7-10 and I. Eze 34:16,17,20,21; Mt 25:32,33 punished. Heb. visited upon. Isa 10:12; 24:21; Jer 11:22; 25:12; Zep 1:8; *margins visited. Ex 4:31; Ru 1:6; Zep 2:7; Lu 1:68; 1Pe 2:12 as. Pr 21:31; So 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-4","title":"Zechariah 10:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>of him came forth. 1:20,21; 9:13-16; 12:6-8; Nu 24:17; Isa 41:14-16; 49:2; 54:16 Jer 1:18; Mic 5:5-8; Mt 9:38; 2Co 10:4,5; Eph 4:8-11; 6:10-17 2Ti 2:4; Re 17:14; 19:13-15 the corner. 1Sa 14:38; Isa 19:13 the nail. Ezr 9:8; Isa 22:23-25 the battle. 9:8,10; Ge 49:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-5","title":"Zechariah 10:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>as. 9:13; 12:8; 1Sa 16:18; 2Sa 22:8; Ps 45:3; Lu 24:19; Ac 7:22; 18:24 2Co 10:4 tread. Ps 18:42; Isa 10:6; 25:10; Mic 7:10; Mt 4:3 because. 14:3,13; De 20:1; Jos 10:14,42; Isa 8:9; 41:12; Joe 3:12-17 Mt 28:20; Ro 8:31-37; 2Ti 4:7,17; Re 19:13-15 and the riders on horses shall be confounded. or, they shallmake the riders on horses ashamed. 12:4; Ps 20:7; 33:16; Eze 38:15; Hag 2:22; Re 19:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-6","title":"Zechariah 10:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>I will strengthen. 12; Ps 89:21; Isa 41:10; Eze 37:16; Ob 1:18; Mic 4:6,13; 5:8; 7:16 Zep 3:19,20 I will save. 8:7; Jer 3:18; 23:6; 31:1,31; Eze 39:25; Ho 1:11; Ro 11:25,26 for I have. Isa 14:1; Jer 31:20; Ho 1:7; 2:23; Mic 7:18-20 as. 8:11; Isa 49:17-21; Jer 30:18; Eze 36:11 for I am. 13:9; Isa 41:17-20; Jer 33:2,3; Eze 36:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-7","title":"Zechariah 10:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>and their. 9:15,17; Ge 43:34; Ps 104:15; Pr 31:6,7; Ac 2:13-18; Eph 5:18,19 yea. Ge 18:19; Ps 90:16; 102:28; Isa 38:19; Jer 32:39; Ac 2:39; 13:33 their heart. 1Sa 2:1; Ps 13:5; 28:7; Isa 66:14; Hab 3:18; Zep 3:14; Lu 1:47 Joh 16:22; Ac 2:26; Php 4:4; 1Pe 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-8","title":"Zechariah 10:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>hiss. Isa 5:26; 7:18; 11:11,12; 27:12,13; 55:1-3; Mt 11:28; Re 22:17 for. 9:11; Isa 44:22; 51:11; 52:1-3; Jer 31:10,11; 1Ti 2:4-6 and they. Ex 1:7; 1Ki 4:20; Isa 49:19-22; Jer 30:19,20; 33:22 Eze 36:10,11,37,38; Ho 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-9","title":"Zechariah 10:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>sow. Es 8:17; Jer 31:27; Da 3:1-6:28; Ho 2:23; Am 9:9; Mic 5:7 Ac 8:1,4; 11:19-21; 13:1-38; 14:1-21:16; Ro 11:11-15 remember. De 30:1-4; 1Ki 8:47,48; Ne 1:9; Jer 51:50; Eze 6:9 live. Isa 65:9,23; Ac 2:38,39; 3:25,26; 13:32,33; Ro 11:16,17,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-10","title":"Zechariah 10:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>out of the. 8:7; Isa 11:11-16; 19:23-25; 27:12,13; Ho 11:11; Mic 7:11,12 into. Jer 22:6; Eze 47:18-21; Ob 1:20; Mic 7:14 place. Isa 49:19-21; 54:2,3; 60:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-11","title":"Zechariah 10:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>he shall. Ps 66:10-12; Isa 11:15,16; 42:15,16; 43:2 smite. Ex 14:21,22,27,28; Jos 3:15-17; 2Ki 2:8,14; Ps 77:16-20; 114:3,5 Isa 11:15; Re 16:12 the pride. Ezr 6:22; Isa 14:25; Mic 5:5,6 the sceptre. Eze 29:14-16; 30:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-10-12","title":"Zechariah 10:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>I will. 6; 12:5; Ps 68:34,35; Isa 41:10; 45:24; Eph 6:10; Php 4:13; 2Ti 2:1 walk. Ge 5:24; 24:40; Isa 2:5; Mic 4:5; Col 2:6; 3:17; 1Th 2:12; 4:1 1Jo 1:6,7</p>"}]}